    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "This impressed me: I asked GPT-6 Astra to turn Zork (the classic 1977 text adventure) into a full 3D action-adventure game\n\nIt kept the original plot &amp; puzzles, added fight scenes, and built all of the characters &amp; environments directly in Threejs\n\nPlay: https://t.co/EUDn7ZPIv5 https://t.co/ls97ON2Plp",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/emollick/status/2096047660662722620",
    "time": "2026-09-05 09:27",
    "created_at": "Sat Sep 05 01:27:59 +0000 2026",
