    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "The AI had to make a lot of judgement calls to make a playable version of a text version of the game the is still interesting (and you can still be eaten by a Grue).\n\nAll the prompts &amp; nudges I gave it are in the image.\n\nAnd here it is open source: https://t.co/4lMxhyNGTa https://t.co/gaGCyZEtsI",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/emollick/status/2096051087471943969",
    "time": "2026-09-05 09:41",
    "created_at": "Sat Sep 05 01:41:36 +0000 2026",
    "id_str": "2096051087471943969",
    "is_retweet": false
  },
  {
    "username": "emollick",
    "nickname": "Ethan Mollick",
    "text": "For the people getting mad. Yes, I played Zork. No, I never won Zork. Yes, Zork is open source. And I can't do anything worse to the series that Return to Zork (pictured) didn't already do. https://t.co/EHC4mLYPMO",
    "quoted_tweet": null,
    "url": "https://twitter.com/emollick/status/2096054442055336380",
